## Type mapping

| Arrow physical type | API wire type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `FixedSizeBinary(16)` | `String` (lowercase hex) | trace_id, batch_id |
| `FixedSizeBinary(8)` | `String` (lowercase hex) | span_id |
| `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | `DateTime<Utc>` (RFC3339) | All timestamps |
| `Utf8` | `String` or `serde_json::Value` | Attributes are JSON-parsed |
| `Int64` nullable | `Option<i64>` | Token counts, counts, and other unsigned OTLP values |
| `Float64` nullable | `Option<f64>` | Scores, values |
